OL,3,AConvicted Bosnian Serb war criminal
OL,4,AMladiDG dies aged 84
OL,5,
OL,6,FConvicted Bosnian Serb war criminal
OL,7,FRatko MladiDG has died in a UN prison
OL,8,Fat The Hague aged 84.
OL,10,FHe was jailed for life in 2017 for
OL,11,Fgenocide, war crimes and crimes against
OL,12,Fhumanity during the wars in the former
OL,13,FYugoslavia in 1992-95.
OL,15,FAfter the Bosnian war, he went on the
OL,16,Frun for 16 years until he was finally
OL,17,Ftracked down in rural Serbia in 2011
OL,18,Fand put on trial in the Dutch city.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
